# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF, and check out LF on every
# platform. A CRLF shell script or Dockerfile breaks inside a Linux container
# (`/bin/sh^M: bad interpreter`), and Windows developers here run with
# core.autocrlf=true, which otherwise produces CRLF working copies.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile* text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.prisma text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf

# Binary files: never diff/merge as text
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
